*with a computer** to join lobbies with your friends, **change your name** and **change the colour of your fur! \ud83d\udc40**\n\n# **FOREST \ud83c\udf32**\n**The beloved map of horizon** goof around, play the piano, bounce on the trampoline, leap from each branch! **And so much more.**\n\n# **STORE \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f**\nIn here **you can buy anything between your fingertips!** Purchase the cosmetic of your choice and **check it out by the mirror,** and make sure to welcome Jamarcus! \ud83d\udc64\n\n# **LAVA \ud83c\udf0b**\n**Lava is a gamemode,** inside of the hub there is a gamemode board, **pick between casual or lava** If you were to pick lava then **you\u2019d have the funnest time with the rising lava! \ud83d\udd25**\n\n# **ADDITIONAL INFO \ud83d\udcac**\n**You must listen to the rules** by either joining the discord or checking out the rule board and **if you were to break it you would face a period of being banned** where you are disabled to play the game. \ud83d\udcd4\n\n**And this game will update every week** so make sure to check out the new update by **checking the game out everyday! \ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f**", "short_description": "Horizon is a game made by Twigvir and uses gorilla locomotion and features multiplayer, shop and exclusive cosmetics for events and roles. \ud83d\udc7e"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonvr/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Twigvir", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonvr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "reco